---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <section
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center px-4 py-24 text-center sm:px-6"
  >
    <p class="text-7xl font-black tracking-tight text-gray-200 dark:text-gray-800">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold">页面走丢了 🧶</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      你要找的内容不存在或已被移动。回首页逛逛，也许能发现有趣的文章。
    </p>
    <a
      href={base}
      class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-lg bg-gray-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-100 dark:text-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-white"
    >
      返回首页
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
